977019512201455", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nao_ario/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/62bec7f7/uploads/origins/d6b106fe-098a-47bf-b6d9-260633da66e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=044c588c57a3304f22e50cded6f76851", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/62bec7f7/uploads/origins/d6b106fe-098a-47bf-b6d9-260633da66e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=044c588c57a3304f22e50cded6f76851, https://si.imgix.net/62bec7f7/uploads/origins/d6b106fe-098a-47bf-b6d9-260633da66e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d99fb0c46fc92cba063635b539dc6a4b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/62bec7f7/uploads/origins/d6b106fe-098a-47bf-b6d9-260633da66e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0420d7fd315c6df6ea10d889501827f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "很高兴再次委托老师！这次邀请老师绘制我的两个OC。\n他们是两个魔法使：两人在一起会去森林或魔法界里去发现探索不同的神奇的植物动物并把它们记录下来，长濑莲很喜欢逗黑川月生气，两个人会在一起调制魔药\n长濑莲：很温柔，不怎么喜欢考虑事情，但需要他时做事会很认真，对喜欢的人会特别开朗\n\n黑川月：是魔法世界的一位巫师\n在现代生活是一位开花店的老板\n最喜欢的花是蓝星花\n喜欢的东西：夜晚的月亮，草莓味的跳跳糖和游戏机\n朋友：长濑莲\n英语口语相当的不错，经常会在说出的话中插入英语单词。做事拼命很上进\n\n所有衣服可以任由老师发挥！\n\n想要两人配置魔药然后莲逗月生气的场景！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1igxlyGRZBXON-vaQFbRUO4MCMz4nYu78", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nao_ario/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/51924be3/uploads/origins/82c4da06-fe98-430d-96e8-901aea88379a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6c6369ee35d416fbb3a8cb620c689319", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/51924be3/uploads/origins/82c4da06-fe98-430d-96e8-901aea88379a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6c6369ee35d416fbb3a8cb620c689319, htt